# Mechanic: Automatic priority after the last payable spell.
# Forcing: Two Forests pay for Runeclaw Bear; Cancel has no blue mana or legal target afterward.
# AI behavior: An empty hand and battlefield leave only turn progression.
# Failure modes: A pending Resolve or Pass before the next land draw exposes an unnecessary stop.
# Card roles: Runeclaw Bear supplies a simple cast, Cancel supplies an inactive instant,
# Forest supplies payment and the next turn's playable land.
# Protocol path: Cast action, state-only resolution and turn progression, then a land action request.
[metadata]
